Notes on what this project does NOT own:

  * Emoji artwork. This game bundles no emoji images. Every emoji is drawn as
    text with the platform's own font (Apple Color Emoji, Noto Color Emoji,
    Segoe UI Emoji), so the artwork belongs to those vendors and is never
    redistributed by this project. See docs/emoji.html.
  * Weather data comes from Open-Meteo (CC BY 4.0) and is fetched at runtime.

If you would rather release this openly later, MIT is the usual choice and
replacing this file is all it takes.
